{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-03",
  "title": "Courage and Mortality",
  "storyCode": "5-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4bd30ff5cc57f2b639f6d9b4f30d0e729470b219e4453a42d4beb93f893ca264",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Why is everyone running away?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Attack her with Arts! Stop running!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "S-stop! She, she's coming this way! Stop her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Where are all the others?! Why..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "You're the last one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Aaaaah...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Demon... S-someone save me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "...You planned to stop me like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "No, I... No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "You planned to stop me... like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Spare me! Please!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "You're not even worthy of being food for my Hannya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Noooooo!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Holy... We haven't even launched our attack yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "She destroyed Reunion alone, in just two and a half minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "She truly is a demon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Just be glad that you didn't meet her five years ago. It's been a long time since I last saw her fight like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "What about the stragglers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "They've already been captured by our various squads."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "...Madam Ch'en, Inspector Hoshiguma seems to be waving at you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Medic, come with me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Hoshiguma, what else did you ask those Reunion members?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "I asked them if the warehouse was rigged."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "If the entire warehouse is hooked up with explosives..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "We'll throw them in, one by one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "So?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Nothing. Phal made his way here after he was ambushed. Reunion originally was set up around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Ch'en, pull on the door's right side. I'll get the left."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...It seems to be jammed and won't budge. Let me try cutting a hole first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "No need, I'll just tear it apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "(BOOOOM!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It's open!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "XR02, tell me your location! XR02!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "XR02!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Madam Ch'en... I hear fighting outside. The warehouse door... was busted open. It might be Reunion. I'll take care of it myself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Stop, that's me! Don't hang up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Is that you, Madam Ch'en? That's a relief... I'm... all the way in the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "That wound... what happened to your eyes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I wasn't careful enough, got hit by Arts. Don't worry about it, it doesn't matter now. This... *cough*... is for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Medic, staunch his bleeding!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "No... Madam Ch'en, there's no need. I've already accepted..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Stop talking!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's true. Do you see how many times I've been shot? I'm blind, and don't want to move anymore. I've had enough of the pain. I'm so tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Take it, Madam Ch'en... S249TA, F106."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "49. I've memorized the location."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Details are on the paper. The intel about Reunion's infiltration was not sent to the other leaders, but just to one party... There must be a reason behind it. You must look into it, the sooner the better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "*cough*... It was no easy task for me to get this... Anyway, Madam Ch'en, I didn't expect things to end up like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Even though I was finally able to make a contribution, I didn't think this would be how I did it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "None of us did. Thanks to your bravery, we now have a chance to stop the enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Haha... *cough*... I never liked Lungmen, and Lungmen never liked me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "But now, I've finally managed to do something for Lungmen. Not bad for a bum like me, right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You're calling one of the Chung Shui Big Three a bum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Compared to you, Madam Oni, I'm nothing more than a bum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "...Madam Ch'en, how's Madam Oni doing? Is she still working as Inspector?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "She is. She's been my partner for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, Madam Oni... is too honest and frank. No one in the gang... *cough*... dared to challenge her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "But she is no match for those Lungmen moguls. Please keep an eye on her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Don't let anyone demean her. I won't let those stuck-up plutocrats insult her because of her background!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "This is the only favor I ask of you. Just one... *cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Don't worry about that. Hoshiguma is very strong. No one can hurt her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "No matter how powerful, everyone has their limits."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "The entire L.G.D. stands with her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Good, that's a relief. Madam Oni, Madam Ch'en, I have no regrets now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, are you still here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Am I a good person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "A few years ago, a bit hard to say. But now you are, without a doubt. Lungmen is proud of having citizens like you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Hahaha... *cough*... Haha... a pathetic Infected can be a good citizen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Some people in Lungmen are indeed obsessed with Oripathy, but you'd be better off asking Lungmen directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "How do I do that? Will a city answer me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Heh. I will, on its behalf."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And it says, 'I don't mind.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Phal, you have always been - and always will be - one of Lungmen's best."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Thank you, Madam Ch'en. Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Madam Chen, there are two things I'd like you to relay to Madam Oni."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You should tell her yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "What do you mean? Are you saying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "...Boss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It's me. I'm right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, you should've told me sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "She chose to not say anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Boss, did I do a good job?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Not good enough. You can't call it a good job until you survive to see things through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Well damn, haha... I've already used up my luck to have you carry me on your back, Boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Anywhere you want to go? You always refused to tell me where you came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Here, Lungmen. As a matter of fact, I've never been to other cities. If possible, just bury me in that old place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "The hideout? But... that place is a complete wreck now, long deserted. To be honest, I'm not sure how I'd clean it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "It's okay. As long as I'm... with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "Boss... Even though we've always been scared of you, we've also always... cheered you on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Informant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_013",
      "text": "We've always... cheered..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Same here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
